{
  "id": "positive_displacement_pumps",
  "title": "Positive Displacement Pumps",
  "description": "A Positive Displacement Pump has an expanding cavity on the suction side and a decreasing cavity on the discharge side. This tool provides calculators for speed corrections based on liquid viscosity and water temperature for both reciprocating and rotary pumps.",
